# PSR-3c — Alias expiry + phase archival inventory

## Scope

| Work | In this wave | Deferred |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Consumer scan of COMPAT_ALIAS candidates | Yes | — |
| Remove zero-CI aliases after retarget | Yes (2) | — |
| Retarget AGENTS / docs command lists | Yes | Full phase-0 doc pack rewrite |
| Delete CI-bound `phase-0:foundation-gate` | **No** | Separate CI migration |
| Remove `test:contract` / covenant / trunk | **No** | Phase-0 doc + report retarget |
| Bulk delete / archive `phase-*` commands | **No** | Per-command proof later |

## Removed executables

| Alias | Canonical | Consumers retargeted |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `guard:documentation-sync` | `guard:doc-sync` | `docs/README.md`, `docs/MIGRATION-MAP.md` |
| `phase-3:doc-scaffold` | `doc-gate` | `AGENTS.md` |

`//…` comment markers retained in root `package.json`.

## Retained (with reason)

| Alias | Why retained |
| --- | --- |
| `phase-0:foundation-gate` | `.github/workflows/phase-0-gate.yml` + foundation assert |
| `test:contract` | `docs/phase-0/**` still document `pnpm run test:contract` |
| `phase-0:covenant-gate` | reports + `docs/phase-0/phase-0-ci.md` |
| `phase-0:trunk-gate` | reports + `docs/phase-0/phase-0-ci.md` |

## Phase command archival

Inventory only — see
[`psr-3c-alias-expiry-inventory.yaml`](./psr-3c-alias-expiry-inventory.yaml).

~105 root `phase-*` / `pN*` commands remain. Names referenced from
`.github/workflows` are listed in the YAML. **No phase gate deleted.**

## Metrics

| Metric | Before | After |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| Executable root scripts | 310 | **308** |
| Comment keys | 6 | **7** (`//phase-3:doc-scaffold` added) |
| Aliases removed (PSR-3a+3c) | 2 | **4** |

## Local smoke

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-3c-alias-expiry-smoke.mjs
```

## Exit gate

| Check | Result |
| --- | --- |
| Removed aliases absent from `package.json` executables | required |
| Canonical targets present | required |
| `phase-0:foundation-gate` still present | required |
| `MAIN_BRANCH_REQUIRED_CHECKS` unchanged | required |
| No bulk `phase-*` deletion | required |
